License status of the bundled C runtime
=======================================

No written project-wide license grant is recorded for this directory at this
time.

This runtime originated as the `runner/` tree in the historical
`mstan/snesrecomp` project and includes inherited SNES-emulation components.
It is specifically excluded from the MIT licenses in both the repository root
and `snesrecomp-go/LICENSE`. Copyright remains with the respective authors and
contributors.

Nothing in this notice grants permission to use, copy, modify, or redistribute
material beyond rights supplied by an applicable license on an individual
file or dependency, by a separate permission from the relevant rightsholder,
or by law. See `README.md` and `../ATTRIBUTION.md` for the recorded source
lineage and acknowledgements.
